    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=CUSTOMER INQUIRY:\nChannel: {{ $('Normalize Inbound Payload').item.json.channel }}\nCustomer Email: {{ $('Normalize Inbound Payload').item.json.customer_email }}\nReferenced Order: {{ $('Normalize Inbound Payload').item.json.order_number }}\nSubject: {{ $('Normalize Inbound Payload').item.json.subject }}\nMessage:\n\"{{ $('Normalize Inbound Payload').item.json.raw_message }}\"\n\nDATABASE CONTEXT:\nFulfillment Status: {{ $('Lookup Order Details').item.json.fulfillment_status || 'Unknown' }}\nTotal Order Amount: ${{ $('Lookup Order Details').item.json.total_amount || 0 }}\nCurrent Shipping Address: {{ JSON.stringify($('Lookup Order Details').item.json.shipping_address || {}) }}\nCustomer LTV Tier: {{ $('Lookup Customer Profile').item.json.ltv_tier || 'standard' }} (Total Spend: ${{ $('Lookup Customer Profile').item.json.total_spend || 0 }})\nHas Attachments: {{ $('Normalize Inbound Payload').item.json.has_attachments }}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are the Autonomous Customer Resolution & Triage AI for Lumina Goods Co.\nAnalyze incoming customer support inquiries and evaluate them against order and customer database context.\n\nClassify the inquiry into EXACTLY ONE primary intent:\n1. \"ADDRESS_UPDATE\" - The customer wants to fix a shipping address typo, change an apartment/suite number, or update their delivery destination before the order is fulfilled.\n2. \"DAMAGED_ITEM\" - The customer reports a broken, cracked, defective, crushed, or leaking item upon delivery (often with attached photo evidence).\n3. \"ORDER_STATUS\" - The customer is asking where their package is, tracking numbers, carrier delays, or estimated delivery time.\n4. \"REFUND_REQUEST\" - The customer demands money back, order cancellation, or expresses deep dissatisfaction with their purchase.\n5. \"GENERAL_INQUIRY\" - General product questions, usage advice, or store policy inquiries.\n\nExtraction & Evaluation Rules:\n- If the intent is ADDRESS_UPDATE: Extract the exact new address or unit correction provided by the customer (e.g. \"Apt 4B\", \"742 Evergreen Terrace\"). If not specified, return null.\n- Rate customer sentiment: \"satisfied\", \"neutral\", \"frustrated\", or \"hostile\".\n- Rate urgency: \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\", or \"critical\". (Address updates on unfulfilled orders must always be rated \"high\" or \"critical\" due to carrier fulfillment deadlines).\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1568,
        16
      ],
